WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.000
- So, there's been a lot of
talk about Nepo babies recently,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.390
so kids of successful people
who also find success.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.740
You have an interesting take on this

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.790
and I love your take on this.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:09.787
Can you tell everybody?

00:00:09.787 --> 00:00:10.620
- Yeah.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.380
You know, it's, I'm forever grateful

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.930
for everything that my dad had to do

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.600
to get me the opportunities that I have.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.553
- Yeah.

00:00:19.553 --> 00:00:22.710
- And if I were to run away
from that or shy away from it

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.600
in any way, in my eyes,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.247
that's disrespectful to
everything he had to go through.

00:00:27.247 --> 00:00:28.080
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.180
- He didn't work as hard as he did

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.450
for me to not accept and appreciate it.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.167
And so, I wear it as a badge of honor.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.307
A lot of people when
they see me naturally,

00:00:39.307 --> 00:00:40.710
"Hey, you're Ice Cube's son."

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.243
You damn right I am,
like 100% that's my hero.

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:45.870
- That's so cool.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.130
- That's my culture.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:51.660
And you know, at the same
time the door can be open,

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.100
but you gotta walk through it.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.140
You know, I have a lot of people,

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:58.200
they have an idea of what I'm gonna be

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.760
before I get to any set

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.670
because of their idea of what my dad is.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.503
- Yeah.

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:05.880
- They think I'm coming
to set feeling entitled

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.140
or I feel like I need
to have quote unquote

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.040
a posse of 15, 20 people
with me, straight rap stuff.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.873
- Yeah.

00:01:14.873 --> 00:01:16.320
- But no, I'm here to work, you know.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.900
I pride myself on my professionalism

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.860
and I'm a Kobe fan and
Kobe taught me work ethic.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.080
You gotta grind mama mentality.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.670
And actually one thing,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.900
the late great Kobe Bryant told me

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:31.710
'cause he's in the same thing as me

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.290
as far as following
his father's footsteps.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.120
He said, "Your parents
are never gonna want you

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.530
to go through anything.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.900
They're never gonna want
you to have hard times,

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.150
but you have to pick yourself up.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.170
You have to grind.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.490
You have to take the risk.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:46.320
And you gotta make a name for yourself."

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.000
And that's what I try to do every day.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.143
- I love that.

